^{:go/end 405} (go/method resolveAddrList "resolveAddrList resolves addr using hint and returns a list of\naddresses. The result contains at least one address when error is\nnil.\n" [^{:tag (* Resolver)} r ^context/Context ctx ^string op ^string network ^string addr ^Addr hint] :results [addrList error]
